 <COL N="0414A"></COL> Remensis episcopus, et sanctus Laudus Constanciensis
episcopus, consecratus a Gildardo.</P> <P COM="0414">499.  <CITN>(Ibid.)</CITN>  Subrogatur Flavius 17 <SUP>u</SUP> <SUP>s</SUP>  archiepiscopus
