et Fontinellensi <NOTE N="535*" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">postea additum in margine.</HI></NOTE> .</P> <P COM="0415">730.  <CITN>(Ib.)</CITN>  Defuncto sancto Hugone succedit Ratbertus
Rothomagensis archiepiscopus 27 <SUP>u</SUP> <SUP>s</SUP> .</P> <P COM="0415">741.  <CITN>(739—Ib.)</CITN>  Subrogatur Ragenfridus 28 <SUP>u</SUP> <SUP>s</SUP>  Rothomagensis
